msgid ""
"When parsing a YAML document, if the input does not match your schema (as "
"expressed in your `XxxTraits<>` specializations). YAML I/O will print out an "
"error message and your Input object's `error()` method will return true. For "
"instance, the following document:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../YamlIO.md:194
msgid ""
"Has a key (shoe-size) that is not defined in the schema. YAML I/O will "
"automatically generate this error:"
